 94	## Layer construction
 95	
 96	Construct implementations in `live.layer.ts`:
 97	
 98	1. acquire dependencies;
 99	2. derive private helpers;
100	3. define named operations with exact contract types;
101	4. add spans/log annotations at semantic operations;
102	5. return the service implementation;
103	6. expose a Layer.
104	
105	Avoid side effects during module import.
106	
107	Choose the smallest construction that matches the work:
108	
109	| Construction                                            | Use it when                                                                                                          |
110	| ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
111	| `Layer.succeed(Service, Service.of(implementation))`    | The implementation is already available and construction performs no effects.                                        |
112	| `Layer.effect(Service, effect)`                         | Construction acquires other services, reads Config, or creates Effect-managed state, a cache or a concurrency limit. |
113	| `Layer.effect(Service, effect)` with scoped acquisition | A resource needs release when the Layer's scope closes.                                                              |
